","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in May to June in 33 of 75 years since 1951, and June to July did the same 33 times. In 2025 the middle ran 70% of normal in July to August and 59% in August to September. Grid 27815 had its driest year in 1964 at 71% of normal.</p>"}
